Overgrown Legacy Bridge 0.4.0

The biome category tags, block material tags and damage_over_time damage type
in data/apoli are reused from apace100/apoli v2.9.0 (MIT, copyright 2021 apace100).
The included LICENSE-upstream-apoli preserves the complete copyright and license.
Source: https://github.com/apace100/apoli/tree/v2.9.0/src/main/resources/data/apoli

The built-in power files in data/origins/powers, the power names in
assets/origins/lang and the origins:cobwebs and origins:shields tags are reused
from apace100/origins-fabric v1.10.0 (MIT, copyright 2020 apace100) so legacy
packs that reference the original power IDs keep working. The included
LICENSE-upstream-origins preserves the complete copyright and license.
Source: https://github.com/apace100/origins-fabric/tree/v1.10.0/src/main/resources

Legacy damage-source selection and damage-over-time behavior are adapted from
that project's MIT-licensed implementations. No Origins or Apoli mod jars are
bundled in this artifact.
